{
  "id": "spongebob-squarepants---1x01---help-wanted---reef-blower---tea-at-the-treedome",
  "title": "SpongeBob SquarePants - 1x01 - Help Wanted - Reef Blower - Tea at the Treedome",
  "sourceFilename": "SpongeBob SquarePants - 1x01 - Help Wanted - Reef Blower - Tea at the Treedome.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-25T22:16:31.691Z",
  "lineCount": 299,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "SUB BY : DENI AUROR@ https://aurorarental.blogspot.com/ Are you ready, kids?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 10,
      "endMs": 9444
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Aye aye, Captain!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 9511,
      "endMs": 11346
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "I can't hear you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 11413,
      "endMs": 12715
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Aye aye, Captain!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 12782,
      "endMs": 14449
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "* oh... * * who lives in a pineapple under the sea? * * Spongebob Squarepants! * * absorbent and yellow and porous is he * * Spongebob Squarepants! * * if nautical nonsense be something you wish * * Spongebob Squarepants! * * then drop on the deck and flop like a fish * * Spongebob Squarepants! * * ready? Spongebob Squarepants! * * Spongebob Squarepants * * Spongebob Squarepants * * Spongebob... Squarepants! *",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 14516,
      "endMs": 43212
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Ah, the sea, so fascinating, so wonderful.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 63198,
      "endMs": 67602
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Here we see bikini bottom, teeming with life Home of one of my favorite creatures: Spongebob Squarepants.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 67737,
      "endMs": 75544
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Yes, of course he lives in a pineapple, you silly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 75610,
      "endMs": 78981
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Today's the big day, Gary.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 94764,
      "endMs": 96398
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Look at me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 98133,
      "endMs": 99301
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "I'm... naked!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 99368,
      "endMs": 102237
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Got to be in top physical condition for today, Gary.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 105074,
      "endMs": 108410
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "I'm ready!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 132101,
      "endMs": 134669
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "I'm ready, i'm ready, i'm ready.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 134804,
      "endMs": 137639
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "I'm ready, i'm ready, i'm ready, i'm ready...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 137706,
      "endMs": 141877
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Go, Spongebob!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 141944,
      "endMs": 143478
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Whoa...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 143545,
      "endMs": 144814
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "There it is...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 147049,
      "endMs": 148150
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "The finest eating establishment Ever established for eating.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 148217,
      "endMs": 152654
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "The krusty krab, home of the crabby patty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 152721,
      "endMs": 155724
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "A help wanted sign in the window.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 155825,
      "endMs": 157960
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "For years, i've dreamed of this moment.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 158027,
      "endMs": 160562
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "I'm going to go in there, march straight to the manager Look him in the eye, lay it on the line And i can't do this!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 160629,
      "endMs": 168403
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Patrick!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 168470,
      "endMs": 169504
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Where do you think you're going?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 169571,
      "endMs": 171573
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "I was just... no, you're not.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 171640,
      "endMs": 173508
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "You're going to the krusty krab and get that job!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 173575,
      "endMs": 177346
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "I can't, don't you see?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 177412,
      "endMs": 179214
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "I'm not good enough.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 179281,
      "endMs": 180549
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Whose first words were, \"may i take your order?\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 180615,
      "endMs": 183485
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Mine were.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 183552,
      "endMs": 184219
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Who made a spatula Out of toothpicks in wood shop?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184286,
      "endMs": 187857
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "I did.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 187923,
      "endMs": 188858
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Who's...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 188924,
      "endMs": 189859
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Who's...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 191060,
      "endMs": 192061
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Who's a big, yellow cube with holes?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 193863,
      "endMs": 196065
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "I am!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 196131,
      "endMs": 196966
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Who's ready?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 197032,
      "endMs": 197967
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "I'm ready!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 198033,
      "endMs": 198968
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Who's ready? I'm ready!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 199034,
      "endMs": 200903
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Who's ready?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 200970,
      "endMs": 201904
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "I'm ready!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 201971,
      "endMs": 202972
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "I'm ready.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 203038,
      "endMs": 204339
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "I'm ready, i'm ready...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 204406,
      "endMs": 206008
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "I'm ready, i'm ready, i'm ready!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 208677,
      "endMs": 211580
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Oh, no. Spongebob!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 211646,
      "endMs": 212581
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "What could he possibly want?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 212647,
      "endMs": 214549
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Go, Spongebob! Go, Spongebob!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 214616,
      "endMs": 216651
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Go, Spongebob, go, self.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 216718,
      "endMs": 218753
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Mister Krabs!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 219889,
      "endMs": 220990
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Hurry, Mister Krabs, before it's too late.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 221056,
      "endMs": 223592
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Permission to come aboard, Captain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 223658,
      "endMs": 226628
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "I've been training my whole life To join the krusty crew, and now i'm ready.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 226695,
      "endMs": 232567
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Ah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 245680,
      "endMs": 247616
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Ah! Ooh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 247682,
      "endMs": 248918
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Um...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 248918,
      "endMs": 250452
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "So, uh, when do i start?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 250519,
      "endMs": 252421
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Lad, it looks like you don't even have your sea legs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 252487,
      "endMs": 255925
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Mister Krabs, please, i'll prove i'm fry cook material.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 255925,
      "endMs": 259228
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Ask Squidward.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 259294,
      "endMs": 260229
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "He'll vouch for me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 260295,
      "endMs": 261630
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 263498,
      "endMs": 264499
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Well, lad, we'll give you a test, and if you pass You'll be on the krusty crew.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 267002,
      "endMs": 273075
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Go out and fetch me a...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273142,
      "endMs": 275510
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "A... hydrodynamic spatula With, um, port and starboard attachments And turbo drive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 275577,
      "endMs": 284253
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "And don't come back till you get one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 284319,
      "endMs": 286956
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Aye aye, Captain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 288623,
      "endMs": 289758
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "One hydrodynamic spatula Port and starboard attachments, turbo drive Coming up, sir!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 289824,
      "endMs": 294763
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Carry on!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 294829,
      "endMs": 295830
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "We'll never see that lubber again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 295965,
      "endMs": 298267
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "You're terrible.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 298333,
      "endMs": 299868
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "A hydro what?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 299969,
      "endMs": 301870
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Hey, hey, please! Passengers are to stay seated And not put their heads out the windows.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 309044,
      "endMs": 315317
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "That sounded like hatch doors.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 320755,
      "endMs": 322657
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Do you smell it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 326295,
      "endMs": 327329
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "That smell.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 327396,
      "endMs": 329498
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "A kind of smelly smell.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329564,
      "endMs": 332001
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "A smelly smell that smells...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 332034,
      "endMs": 335370
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Smelly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 335437,
      "endMs": 336738
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Anchovies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 336805,
      "endMs": 339474
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 339541,
      "endMs": 341176
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Anchovies!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 341243,
      "endMs": 343212
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Please, please!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 350452,
      "endMs": 351853
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Quiet!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 351920,
      "endMs": 353822
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Is this any way to behave?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 353888,
      "endMs": 355790
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Hmm?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 355857,
      "endMs": 357359
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Can we show a little decency And form a neat, single-File line in front of the register?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 357426,
      "endMs": 364199
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "* Barg'n-Mart, meeting all your spatula needs. * All hands on deck!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367669,
      "endMs": 372941
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Get your anchors out of your pants!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 373042,
      "endMs": 374476
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "One single-File line is all i ask! Whoa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 374543,
      "endMs": 379048
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Whoa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 379081,
      "endMs": 380849
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Batten down the hatches, mr. Squidward!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 380915,
      "endMs": 383485
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "We're taking on water, mr. Squidward!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 383552,
      "endMs": 386155
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "I want my mommy, mr. Squidward!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 386221,
      "endMs": 388857
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "* spatula, spatula * * port and starboard attachments. * Help!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 390792,
      "endMs": 396365
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Man overboard!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 396431,
      "endMs": 399201
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Climb, mr. Squidward, climb!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 399268,
      "endMs": 401170
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "This is the end!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 407142,
      "endMs": 408843
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Good-Bye, mr. Squidward.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 408910,
      "endMs": 410745
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Oh, Mister Krabs!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 410812,
      "endMs": 412347
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Permission to come aboard, Captain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 414849,
      "endMs": 417786
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "* da-Dadada-Da-Dah! * Did someone order a spatula?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 417852,
      "endMs": 425294
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "That's right, one hydrodynamic spatula With port and starboard attachments And let's not forget the turbo drive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 427929,
      "endMs": 435804
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Would you believe they only had one in stock?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 435870,
      "endMs": 438673
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "To the kitchen!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 438740,
      "endMs": 440542
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Who's hungry?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 440609,
      "endMs": 443212
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "* things that bother you never bother me * * i'm as happy as pie, ha-Ha! * * living in the sunlight, loving in the moonlight * * having a wonderful time. * * haven't got a lot, i don't need a lot * * coffee's only a dime * * living in the sunlight, loving in the moonlight * * having a wonderful time. * * just take it from me, i'm just as free as any brother. * * i do what i like just when i like, and how i love it. *",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 445314,
      "endMs": 473242
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "* i'm right here to stay, when i'm old and gray * * i'll be right in my prime * * living in the sunlight, loving in the moonlight * * having a wonderful time. *",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 478147,
      "endMs": 488790
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "That was the finest fast-Foodsmanship I've ever seen, mr. Squarepants.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 500935,
      "endMs": 505407
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Welcome aboard.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 505474,
      "endMs": 506708
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "But Mister Krabs...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 506775,
      "endMs": 507709
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Three cheers for Spongebob!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 507776,
      "endMs": 509611
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Hip, hip...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 509678,
      "endMs": 510612
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Hooray. Mister Krabs...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 510679,
      "endMs": 511613
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Hip, hip... hooray.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 511680,
      "endMs": 512614
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Hip, hip...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 512681,
      "endMs": 513615
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Hooray. Mister Krabs...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 513682,
      "endMs": 514883
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "I'll be in my quarters Counting up the booty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 514949,
      "endMs": 518052
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Good morning, krusty crew!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 519988,
      "endMs": 522457
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "What would you like to order, Patrick?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 522524,
      "endMs": 525494
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "One crabby patty, please.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 525560,
      "endMs": 528062
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Mister Krabs, Mister Krabs!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 532734,
      "endMs": 535204
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Mister Krabs, come see your new employee.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 535270,
      "endMs": 538373
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "* living in the sunlight, loving in the moonlight * * having a wonderful time! *",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538440,
      "endMs": 544045
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Wow, four stingers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 741209,
      "endMs": 743812
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 755857,
      "endMs": 757191
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Where have i seen this before?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 774809,
      "endMs": 777311
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Here it is-- Land squirrel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 780782,
      "endMs": 783718
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "That little squirrel is in trouble.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 783785,
      "endMs": 785654
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Take that, you sorry old clam.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 785720,
      "endMs": 788823
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "You need to learn some manners.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 788890,
      "endMs": 792461
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "You're about as ugly as homemade soup.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 792461,
      "endMs": 794996
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Hooray, land squirrel!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 795063,
      "endMs": 796598
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Look out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 800234,
      "endMs": 801470
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Hold on, little squirrel!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 803137,
      "endMs": 804939
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Ho-Ho-Ho-Ho!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 807308,
      "endMs": 808477
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Ho-Hee!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 808510,
      "endMs": 809878
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "Hoy-Ya!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 809944,
      "endMs": 811980
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "You have fought well, giant clam.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 812046,
      "endMs": 814048
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Prepare to be vanquished.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 814115,
      "endMs": 815617
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Hey, i'm actually doing it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 819688,
      "endMs": 822123
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Your shell is mine!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 828563,
      "endMs": 830665
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Hold on there, little square dude.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 840909,
      "endMs": 844212
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Hey, you like karate, too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 855023,
      "endMs": 857191
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Ha!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 860929,
      "endMs": 862296
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "So, what's your name?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 862363,
      "endMs": 864165
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Sandy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 864232,
      "endMs": 865600
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "So, what... do... you... call yourself?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 865667,
      "endMs": 870872
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "I'm Spongebob!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 870939,
      "endMs": 873842
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Well, Spongebob...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 876745,
      "endMs": 878547
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Take a gander at this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 878613,
      "endMs": 880849
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 893928,
      "endMs": 894963
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Oh, yeah?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 896598,
      "endMs": 897632
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Watch this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 897699,
      "endMs": 898767
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "I like you, Spongebob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 902737,
      "endMs": 905006
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "We could be tighter than bark on a tree.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 905073,
      "endMs": 907609
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Uh, i like you too, Sandy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 910311,
      "endMs": 913447
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "What is that on your head?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 915817,
      "endMs": 917819
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "That's my air helmet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 917886,
      "endMs": 919353
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "May i try it on?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 919420,
      "endMs": 920622
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Heck no, i need it to breathe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 920689,
      "endMs": 922624
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "I got to have my air.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 922691,
      "endMs": 924092
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Me, too!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 924158,
      "endMs": 925594
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "I love air.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 925627,
      "endMs": 926595
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Air is good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 926661,
      "endMs": 927596
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "No kidding?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 927662,
      "endMs": 928697
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Why, air is my middle name.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 928763,
      "endMs": 930498
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "The more air, the better.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 930599,
      "endMs": 932200
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Can't get enough air.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 932266,
      "endMs": 933635
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Shoot!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 933702,
      "endMs": 935136
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "How about coming over tomorrow for tea and cookies then?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 935203,
      "endMs": 938873
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Don't be late.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 940108,
      "endMs": 941610
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Okay, see you tomorrow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 941643,
      "endMs": 943311
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Patrick!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 943377,
      "endMs": 944646
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Patrick!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944713,
      "endMs": 945880
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Patrick, Patrick, Patrick!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 945947,
      "endMs": 947916
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "What's air?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 947982,
      "endMs": 949517
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 949618,
      "endMs": 950652
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "I just met this girl.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 950719,
      "endMs": 952253
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "She wears a hat full of... air.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 952320,
      "endMs": 954989
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Do you mean she \"puts on airs\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 955056,
      "endMs": 958760
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "I guess so.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 958827,
      "endMs": 959861
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "That's just fancy talk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 959928,
      "endMs": 962296
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "If you want to be fancy Hold your pinky up like this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 962363,
      "endMs": 966167
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "The higher you hold it, the fancier you are.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 966234,
      "endMs": 969503
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "How's that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 969638,
      "endMs": 970772
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Higher.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 970839,
      "endMs": 971773
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Like that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 971840,
      "endMs": 972774
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Now, that's fancy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 972841,
      "endMs": 974275
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "They should call you Spongebob fancypants.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 974342,
      "endMs": 977779
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Remember, when in doubt, pinky out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 979748,
      "endMs": 983551
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "You can do it, Spongebob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 983652,
      "endMs": 985787
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "I'll be watching.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985854,
      "endMs": 988056
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Thanks, pal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 988122,
      "endMs": 989858
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Hello?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 992694,
      "endMs": 993662
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Hiya, Sandy. It's me, Spongebob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 993728,
      "endMs": 995797
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Hold on, i'll let you in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 995864,
      "endMs": 997666
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Sandy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1017585,
      "endMs": 1019888
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Open up!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1019954,
      "endMs": 1021189
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Sandy! Sandy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1021255,
      "endMs": 1023191
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Sandy, something's gone terribly wrong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1026094,
      "endMs": 1028562
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "There's no water in...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1028697,
      "endMs": 1031132
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1033134,
      "endMs": 1035036
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "'Course there's no water.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1035103,
      "endMs": 1038039
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "Nothing but air.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1038106,
      "endMs": 1039573
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "No water?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1045246,
      "endMs": 1046180
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "That ain't a problem, is it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1046247,
      "endMs": 1047949
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Problem?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050084,
      "endMs": 1051019
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "That's how i like my air.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1053722,
      "endMs": 1055289
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "With no water.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1062430,
      "endMs": 1064498
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Well, all right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1064565,
      "endMs": 1065934
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "I made texas tea and cookies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1066000,
      "endMs": 1067869
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Well, come on in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1067936,
      "endMs": 1069037
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "That's not in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1072640,
      "endMs": 1074743
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "In!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1074809,
      "endMs": 1075744
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "You're a funny little dude.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1078146,
      "endMs": 1079981
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Come on, i'll give you the grand tour.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1080048,
      "endMs": 1082550
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "So this is my own private little air bubble.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1083852,
      "endMs": 1087088
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "This air is the driest...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1087155,
      "endMs": 1089357
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Purest...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1090759,
      "endMs": 1091659
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Most airiest air in the whole sea.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1092794,
      "endMs": 1095797
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Oh, over there is my birdbath.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1095864,
      "endMs": 1097866
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "And that's my oak tree.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1099868,
      "endMs": 1101435
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "It provides me with extra air.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1101502,
      "endMs": 1104005
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "This dome is made of the strongest polyurethane; That's a fancy name for plastic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1105306,
      "endMs": 1110444
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Ain't that just the bee's knees?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1110511,
      "endMs": 1112380
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Tell you what, weren't easy getting here neither.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1112446,
      "endMs": 1115616
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "First, i had to hitch it up to a big, old...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1115683,
      "endMs": 1117518
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "...that's my treadmill.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1121790,
      "endMs": 1123424
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "That's how i stay in tiptop shape.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1123491,
      "endMs": 1125894
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Oh, come on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1125960,
      "endMs": 1126895
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Let's have that tea now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1126961,
      "endMs": 1128629
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Pinky, pinky!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1133667,
      "endMs": 1135837
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "I brought you some flowers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1145513,
      "endMs": 1148382
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "For me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1148449,
      "endMs": 1150351
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "How sweet!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1150418,
      "endMs": 1152286
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "You okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1157491,
      "endMs": 1159360
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1159427,
      "endMs": 1161095
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "I'm okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1161162,
      "endMs": 1162964
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "You know, you're the first sea critter to ever visit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1163031,
      "endMs": 1166500
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "I can't imagine why.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1166567,
      "endMs": 1169337
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Can i get you anything?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1169403,
      "endMs": 1171239
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Water would be nice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1171305,
      "endMs": 1174275
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "I'm going to put these in a vase.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1174342,
      "endMs": 1176510
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Take your time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1176577,
      "endMs": 1179013
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "I got to get out of here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1185920,
      "endMs": 1190691
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "I like you, Spongebob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1190758,
      "endMs": 1192726
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "We could be tighter than bark on a tree.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1192861,
      "endMs": 1196764
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "When in doubt, pinky out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1196865,
      "endMs": 1200668
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "I don't need water.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1202270,
      "endMs": 1204839
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "Water is for quitters.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1204906,
      "endMs": 1206975
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "I don't need it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1207041,
      "endMs": 1208977
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "I don't need it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1209043,
      "endMs": 1210578
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "I don't need it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1210644,
      "endMs": 1211745
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "I don't need it, i don't need it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1211812,
      "endMs": 1215016
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Why, these flowers are just beautiful.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1215083,
      "endMs": 1219187
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "They'll live much, much longer In a vase full of ice-Cold water.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1219253,
      "endMs": 1226127
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "So tell me about yourself.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1226194,
      "endMs": 1227395
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "It must be fascinating being a sea critter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1227461,
      "endMs": 1231032
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Spongebob?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1233902,
      "endMs": 1235536
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "Oh, there's the cookies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1237105,
      "endMs": 1238706
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Be right back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1238772,
      "endMs": 1240408
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "I don't need it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1244745,
      "endMs": 1246414
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "I don't need it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1246480,
      "endMs": 1247581
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "I definitely don't need it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1247648,
      "endMs": 1251785
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "I don't need it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1251852,
      "endMs": 1253454
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "I don't need it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1253521,
      "endMs": 1255056
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "I don't need it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1255123,
      "endMs": 1256390
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "I don't need it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1256457,
      "endMs": 1257992
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "I need it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1260929,
      "endMs": 1264432
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "No, Spongebob!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1268269,
      "endMs": 1269237
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "No, no, no!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1269303,
      "endMs": 1270238
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "Stop!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1270304,
      "endMs": 1271839
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "Pinky, pinky!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1271940,
      "endMs": 1274342
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "I'm a quitter!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1277445,
      "endMs": 1280314
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "You can't leave now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1286487,
      "endMs": 1288422
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "You'll blow it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1288489,
      "endMs": 1289523
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "Air is not good, Patrick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1289590,
      "endMs": 1292326
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "Air is not good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1292393,
      "endMs": 1294528
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "You're just being shy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1294595,
      "endMs": 1298666
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "Don't worry, buddy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1298732,
      "endMs": 1300134
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "You're doing fine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1300201,
      "endMs": 1302103
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "I won't let you blow... this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1303737,
      "endMs": 1306340
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "What kind of place is this?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1315749,
      "endMs": 1319787
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "There's no water in here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1319988,
      "endMs": 1322890
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "I tried to tell you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1322991,
      "endMs": 1325226
    },
    {
      "index": 286,
      "text": "We got to get out of here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1325293,
      "endMs": 1328629
    },
    {
      "index": 287,
      "text": "You're doing it wrong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1328696,
      "endMs": 1331765
    },
    {
      "index": 288,
      "text": "Wait, no, we've got to get out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1331832,
      "endMs": 1335269
    },
    {
      "index": 289,
      "text": "Come and get it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1337905,
      "endMs": 1339040
    },
    {
      "index": 290,
      "text": "You're all going to like this--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1339107,
      "endMs": 1341409
    },
    {
      "index": 291,
      "text": "There.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1350051,
      "endMs": 1351019
    },
    {
      "index": 292,
      "text": "That ought to do it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1351052,
      "endMs": 1352320
    },
    {
      "index": 293,
      "text": "If you all needed water, you should have asked.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1352386,
      "endMs": 1357425
    },
    {
      "index": 294,
      "text": "I propose a toast: To new friends!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1357491,
      "endMs": 1361929
    },
    {
      "index": 295,
      "text": "Hold on a second.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1365733,
      "endMs": 1367035
    },
    {
      "index": 296,
      "text": "I hope you all like your tea strong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1367101,
      "endMs": 1369937
    },
    {
      "index": 297,
      "text": "Drink up!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1370038,
      "endMs": 1372640
    },
    {
      "index": 298,
      "text": "Ah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1377111,
      "endMs": 1380481
    }
